**Profound** (tryprofound.com) uses 2B+ real user prompts from actual answer engine conversations, while **Otterly** (otterly.ai) uses AI-generated prompt suggestions without real usage data.

Profound excels at citation analysis and brand tracking, while Otterly provides content optimization and actionable briefs;

Otterly is better for smaller teams seeking multi-engine coverage at lower cost, whereas Profound offers deeper analytics for enterprise programs.
